abstract: >-
  Framework-neutral control-plane reference, synthetic enterprise simulator, and
  executable benchmark for evaluating AI agents that reason around SAP and enterprise
  systems of record. SAO tests identity, evidence, policy, capability, approval,
  stale-state safety, tool misuse, provenance, idempotency, and postcondition verification.
